# CR 601 on a noncreature permanent: Millstone ({2}, Artifact) routes through
# APIPermanentNoncreature rather than APIPermanentCreature (CastSpell picks
# the API off Card.Type, castspell.go) -- permanentEffect does not care which
# one named it, so the resolution is identical either way.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 G
tapformana human 3 G
queue paygeneric G
queue paygeneric G
castspell human 1
resolvestack
